{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07277","headline":"酬包谏议佶见寄之什 · 刘长卿","name":"酬包谏议佶见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佐郡媿顽疎，殊方亲里闾。\n家贫寒未度，身老岁将除。\n过雪山僧至，依阳野客舒。\n药陈随远宦，梅发对幽居。\n落日栖鴞鸟，行人遗鲤鱼。\n高文不可和，空媿学相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}